  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Desk appraisal of contribution to the Rome process.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the desk appraisal is to provide quality-assurance of the Danish contribution to the Rome Process/Mattei Plan Financing Facility (RPFF), a multi-donor facility managed by the AfDB to tackle the root causes of migration and displacement through strategic, climate-aligned investments in infrastructure. As such the desk appraisal will be used to consider adjustments to projects objectives to ensure the best possible base for activities to be carried out under the project.</narrative>
  </description>
